OL,3,GNEWSA'Dwarfism meet-ups help boost
OL,4,Aself-confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and daughter who live with
OL,7,Fdwarfism say a charity that organises
OL,8,Fmeet-ups with people of the same height
OL,9,Fmakes a huge difference to their lives.
OL,11,FRosie, 13, and her mum Hilary, from
OL,12,FSouth Gloucestershire, say the
OL,13,Fgatherings, ran by charity Little
OL,14,FPeople, allow them to meet people who
OL,15,Fare the same height and share their
OL,16,Fexperiences.
OL,18,FThe charity, co-founded by actor
OL,19,FWarwick Davis in 2012, is able to run
OL,20,Fits sessions partly thanks to funding
OL,21,Ffrom Children in Need.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
