OL,3,GNEWSA'Dwarfism meet-ups help boost
OL,4,Aself-confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalking about the group, Hilary said:
OL,7,F"For her, it really helps her
OL,8,Fself-confidence, having someone of that
OL,9,Fage to talk to that's looking ahead and
OL,10,Fseeing what's in front of them, like
OL,11,Fdriving, university."
